5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look beyond the science to the hands that hold it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I wonder if the money we get actually buys the same things as before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried our past guesses about success were not very accurate.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know where projects usually get stuck before they start.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"The shared facilities are the backbone, so I need to check their status.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
