35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The staffing rolls are concerning. Most phenotyping technicians have left for industry.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The ledgers show vehicle costs frozen, but shipping charges have climbed significantly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The closeout files show catalogue-style awards are still useful a decade later.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The portfolio review shows breeding colony projects overrun schedules twice as often.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The animal facility is accredited, but the glasshouse blocks are fully booked.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, that confirms my fear. The technical hands are gone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, that is worrying. But the computing hours are free now.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, free computing is good, but the spectroscopy suite was idle for weeks.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, the field sites lost a whole season to flooding. That is a big risk.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, yes, the field work is risky. The indoor holding rooms were fine.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The modelling analysts are seconded abroad until next autumn. That is a gap.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"The bench-fee subsidy for glasshouse space was extended, which helps.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The mechanism-focused awards often ended with their central question unresolved.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The live breeding colonies are a major source of delay.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,The glasshouse crew came through the restructuring at full strength.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,We must consider who is actually here to do the work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,The value of the grant is shifting towards what we pay for ourselves.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,We should trust the data from finished awards more than our instincts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,We need to avoid projects that rely on unstable biological systems.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,"The shared facilities are a bottleneck, but the glasshouse is ready.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
