66,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, but the shipping costs for soil samples in A are high.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, true. And the field sites for A are prone to flooding.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, yes. Candidate D avoids the breeding colony risks of C.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
