72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"D is a controlled trial, which is more predictable than field work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,D avoids the schedule overruns associated with live breeding.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,I am confident in D. The infrastructure is in place and the team is ready.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,I will vote for D. It aligns with the available resources.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I will vote for D. The costs are manageable and the facilities are ready.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will vote for D. It is the most predictable and well-supported option.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Takumi,,I will vote for D. It avoids the major risks of the other candidates.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,I will vote for D. It is the best fit for our current capabilities.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
